# eai-standard client base (PROTOCOL §2.4: one client base image, pinned by digest, for the agent container and the
# verifier of every standard task). Generators read it; ci_checks/check-standard-client.sh enforces it. The digest is the
# one main's KinDER and HumanoidBench standard tasks use, so every v1.0 standard task shares one client image.
CLIENT_IMAGE=docker.io/library/python:3.12.14-slim@sha256:f77ac9e44ae96ef2c90b8053ea08c31f8be030f824196b0ae4db6d462c84e51f
CLIENT_REQUIREMENTS=client-requirements.txt
